        "body": "<p>I’m <strong>Shaun Walford</strong>, founder and creator of <strong>The Story Till Now</strong>.</p><p>Before this became my life, I worked as a corporate project manager, structured days, safe routines, and weekend escapes whenever I could find them. Those escapes slowly turned into something bigger: years of remote trails, hard lessons, broken parts, and stories worth sharing.</p><p>TSTN was built from that experience — real gear, real travel, real mistakes, and the kind of knowledge you only earn by getting out there.</p>",
